WEBVTT

00:02:56.090 --> 00:02:57.850
So what do we do?

00:02:58.490 --> 00:03:01.980
What do we do? We help people, what else?

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:08.890
I doubt they've come beyond here.

00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:12.530
Pull back!

00:04:12.900 --> 00:04:17.060
You're not going to rescue anyone? With this many people hurt...

00:04:18.440 --> 00:04:23.370
Our mission is only to exterminate Gilgamesh.

00:04:23.980 --> 00:04:26.940
It's not to protect the citizens' lives and property.

00:04:29.250 --> 00:04:33.910
I'll leave this place to you kids. Do your best for me now.

00:05:00.950 --> 00:05:01.910
Come on.

00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:04.810
There's one there.

00:06:23.660 --> 00:06:24.630
Fire!

00:06:41.550 --> 00:06:43.710
Unit Two, it's your turn.

00:08:57.720 --> 00:08:59.050
Hello.

00:08:59.050 --> 00:09:02.040
Why are you little creeps in a place like this?

00:09:02.790 --> 00:09:05.120
We came to get food.

00:09:05.120 --> 00:09:07.890
We ain't got nothing to give to the likes of you.

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:10.690
If you go back to the Hotel, you can have all the luxuries you want.

00:09:11.260 --> 00:09:12.520
Get the hell out of my sight.

00:09:13.500 --> 00:09:16.330
There are people over there who can't move.

00:09:16.330 --> 00:09:20.500
We came to get their share of food too. Please.

00:09:30.380 --> 00:09:32.140
Thank you very much.

00:09:39.220 --> 00:09:41.420
Young fella... Young fella!

00:09:43.430 --> 00:09:46.420
Your big sister doing okay? Your fine-looking sister?

00:09:53.640 --> 00:09:54.940
Yes...

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.010
I won't do anything.

00:11:54.160 --> 00:11:55.720
I'll leave right away.

00:12:04.700 --> 00:12:06.800
You should still be lying down.

00:12:06.800 --> 00:12:08.400
Why...

00:12:08.540 --> 00:12:10.970
You saved me before, right?

00:12:17.110 --> 00:12:19.840
You were collapsed on the ground right in front of me.

00:12:22.920 --> 00:12:24.440
Now we're even.

00:12:25.890 --> 00:12:27.150
That...

00:12:28.560 --> 00:12:32.360
I found it that day, the day I met you.

00:12:33.330 --> 00:12:34.560
That rainy day...

00:12:35.400 --> 00:12:36.370
Yes...

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:38.460
I see...

00:12:40.470 --> 00:12:43.440
It already feels like such a long time ago.

00:12:45.240 --> 00:12:46.800
And your younger brother?

00:12:48.350 --> 00:12:51.340
I moved here by myself.

00:12:53.450 --> 00:12:56.550
That's a sad thing.

00:12:57.420 --> 00:12:59.010
I see him sometimes.

00:13:12.940 --> 00:13:14.200
What?

00:13:15.670 --> 00:13:17.700
The sound of water in the kitchen.

00:13:20.910 --> 00:13:21.940
Oh...

00:13:28.650 --> 00:13:30.090
That's impressive.

00:13:31.060 --> 00:13:34.790
On nights when I can't sleep, I even listen to the sound of my own heart.

00:13:36.860 --> 00:13:38.520
I listened to the sound of your heart too.

00:13:47.000 --> 00:13:51.910
You'd collapsed, so I tried putting my ear to your chest, thinking you might be dead.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:53.430
That's when I heard...

00:13:57.820 --> 00:13:58.980
Thank you.

00:14:04.490 --> 00:14:05.890
Do you want something to drink?

00:14:37.360 --> 00:14:38.450
No!

00:14:41.830 --> 00:14:43.450
With your body in that shape...

00:14:45.160 --> 00:14:46.490
I said no!

00:15:13.160 --> 00:15:14.560
I have to go.

00:15:15.330 --> 00:15:16.990
They're all waiting for me.

00:15:18.030 --> 00:15:21.590
That mess outside is because of you guys, isn't it?

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:25.930
What did you do?

00:15:27.810 --> 00:15:29.970
Are you going off to kill somebody again?

00:15:30.880 --> 00:15:34.110
That's a sad thing.

00:16:05.610 --> 00:16:08.040
We got beaten in the end, didn't we?

00:16:08.910 --> 00:16:12.780
We did everything we could. There's nothing to be done about it.

00:16:13.180 --> 00:16:18.150
If that Kazamatsuri guy has that secret force, he could've sent them out from the start.

00:16:18.760 --> 00:16:21.380
There's some "adult reason" for it, I'm sure.

00:16:22.030 --> 00:16:26.460
Come to think of it, Madoka, something was a little strange with you in the middle of the fight.

00:16:27.730 --> 00:16:28.660
Strange?

00:16:29.800 --> 00:16:31.060
For just an instant.

00:16:34.570 --> 00:16:35.560
Are you all right?

00:16:36.510 --> 00:16:37.580
Yeah...

00:16:37.580 --> 00:16:40.240
You were just zoning out again, weren't you?

00:16:41.910 --> 00:16:44.320
Oh! Your sneezing stopped!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:46.040
Huh? It's true!

00:16:50.920 --> 00:16:52.220
What's wrong?

00:16:52.220 --> 00:16:53.250
Over there...

00:17:04.470 --> 00:17:05.570
This is for real, huh?

00:17:05.570 --> 00:17:08.370
Yeah, that building is going to collapse soon.

00:17:09.140 --> 00:17:10.510
If something like that were to happen...

00:17:10.510 --> 00:17:11.480
Let's go.

00:17:17.550 --> 00:17:18.120
<i>What happened?</i>

00:17:18.120 --> 00:17:19.220
<i>What's that noise?</i>

00:17:19.220 --> 00:17:20.250
<i>Are you okay?</i>

00:17:20.250 --> 00:17:21.220
<i>Something's got to be wrong!</i>

00:17:21.220 --> 00:17:22.240
<i>No way!</i>

00:17:22.620 --> 00:17:23.780
<i>This is bad!</i>

00:17:24.920 --> 00:17:26.460
What do we do?

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.690
We'll knock it down away from the park.

00:17:28.930 --> 00:17:30.550
Madoka and I will go at it from the air.

00:17:31.330 --> 00:17:33.030
Fu and Toru, you handle things here.

00:17:33.030 --> 00:17:34.000
Got it.

00:17:34.830 --> 00:17:35.800
Madoka...

00:17:38.140 --> 00:17:39.200
Here we go.

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.500
Right!

00:17:46.010 --> 00:17:48.980
I knew it! Something this big is impossible!

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:50.080
Don't give up!

00:17:50.080 --> 00:17:52.050
Worst-case scenario, we'll just take it straight down.

00:17:52.050 --> 00:17:53.480
This is bad!

00:17:53.480 --> 00:17:54.820
Isamu!

00:17:58.020 --> 00:17:59.080
So it's no use?

00:18:12.370 --> 00:18:13.630
Is this for real?

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:24.810
Over there!

00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:32.850
What are you doing here?

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:41.330
I heard so many screams... I couldn't sleep.

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:58.610
It's true. I just now realized there were this many.

00:18:59.250 --> 00:19:02.550
It's not likely there's anyone who could sleep tonight.

00:19:03.690 --> 00:19:04.650
Yeah...

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:24.740
You're all uninjured, right?

00:19:24.740 --> 00:19:26.470
But the town is...

00:19:45.660 --> 00:19:49.500
The Chairman is worried about you. Go home, please.

00:19:51.770 --> 00:19:53.630
Please, go home.

00:20:13.320 --> 00:20:17.090
The October Project has ended in an unfortunate outcome.

00:20:17.900 --> 00:20:20.990
My sincerest regrets about Dr. Enuma as well.

00:20:21.730 --> 00:20:24.630
Didn't things turn out precisely as you'd hoped?

00:20:25.770 --> 00:20:29.400
I am no more than a representative for the Chairman, you see.

00:20:30.270 --> 00:20:34.710
In total, there were ten Gilgamesh test subjects which Enkidu brought out of Uruk.

00:20:35.580 --> 00:20:39.110
Of those, we have done away with four.

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:45.750
Six of the creatures remain. All of you please do your utmost as well,

00:20:46.790 --> 00:20:49.620
...though I earnestly ask that you not get in our way.

00:20:50.330 --> 00:20:55.630
With that I bid you adieu, Countess of Werdenberg.

00:23:24.720 --> 00:23:27.320
I'm going out for a bit. I won't mind if you clear out of here while I'm gone.

00:23:27.320 --> 00:23:29.220
This is the place where we first met.

00:23:29.220 --> 00:23:31.920
In this world, there's not a single thing that goes the way you want it to.

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.920
How can you be so gentle?

00:23:33.920 --> 00:23:35.030
...the piano had been my escape,

00:23:35.030 --> 00:23:36.490
because reality was just so horrible.

00:23:36.490 --> 00:23:38.430
It's raining again, just like that time.

00:23:38.430 --> 00:23:41.000
If you gently touch the keys, they'll play a gentle tone for you.

00:23:41.000 --> 00:23:42.970
We took shelter from the rain under that piano,

00:23:42.970 --> 00:23:44.900
...then we fled inside here and met you.

00:23:44.900 --> 00:23:48.770
Just maybe you might save me from this reality...

00:23:48.770 --> 00:23:50.110
That's what I thought.

00:23:50.110 --> 00:23:53.370
At the time, that's really what I thought!
